msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: BlazBlue Calamity Trigger Ukrainian Translation\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: uk\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=3; plural=(n%10==1 && n%100!=11 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);\n"

#. Key: ArcEveLC01_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: あらあら、かわいい子、お人形さんみたい。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC01_00"
msgid "Oh, my... What a cute little girl. Are you lost?"
msgstr "Ой, яка мила дівчинка, наче лялечка."

#. Key: ArcEveLC01_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: アナタ、どこから来たのかな？
#. JA:   お父さんかお母さんは一緒じゃないの？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC01_01"
msgid ""
"Where are you from?\n"
"Where are your mommy and daddy?"
msgstr "Ти звідки? Тато чи мама не з тобою?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC01_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
msgctxt "ArcEveLC01_02"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: ArcEveLC01_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: いいお洋服着てるからこの辺りの子ではないと思うし。
#. JA:   どうしましょう？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC01_03"
msgid ""
"You're wearing such nice clothes...\n"
"You must not be from around here.\n"
"What should I do...?"
msgstr ""
"На тобі такий гарний одяг... Ти, певно, не місцева. Що ж\n"
"робити?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC01_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: あなた、少し変わったわね。
#. JA:   力を手に入れて決心がついたのかしら？強い意志を感じるわ。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC01_04"
msgid ""
"I see you have changed.\n"
"Have you found the strength you sought?\n"
"I see you are determined, if nothing else."
msgstr ""
"Ти трохи змінилася. Мабуть, здобута сила допомогла тобі\n"
"зважитися? Я відчуваю в тобі тверду волю."

#. Key: ArcEveLC01_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: え～と、どうしたのかな？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC01_05"
msgid "Uhh... What are you talking about?"
msgstr "Е-е... Що з тобою?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC01_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: あなたが救おうとしているのは、知識を追い求めるあまり
#. JA:   人であることを捨て、境界の門を叩いて、
#. JA:   最後はその知識に喰われた愚か者よ。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC01_06"
msgid ""
"The one who you're trying to save gave away his humanity\n"
"to enter another world. He was consumed by the\n"
"knowledge he sought. What a fool."
msgstr ""
"Той, кого ти намагаєшся врятувати, у гонитві за знаннями\n"
"зрікся людяності, постукав у браму Межі й зрештою був\n"
"пожертий цими знаннями. Який дурень."

#. Key: ArcEveLC01_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: まぁ、それを知っていてなお手を差し伸べるあなたも同類かしら？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC01_07"
msgid ""
"You still pursue him even though you know his fate...\n"
"Perhaps you are more like him than you realize."
msgstr ""
"Та, мабуть, і ти така сама, раз, знаючи все це, досі\n"
"простягаєш йому руку."

#. Key: ArcEveLC01_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ――アナタ、何者！？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC01_08"
msgid "Who...who are you!?"
msgstr "Ти... хто така!?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC01_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: あら、怖い顔しないで「お嬢さん」？
#. JA:   まだ時間もあるようだし、暇つぶしに遊んであげる。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC01_09"
msgid ""
"Why the frightened face, child?\n"
"Ah well. There is nothing pressing at the moment.\n"
"I will spare a moment to play with you."
msgstr ""
"Ну-ну, не дивися так грізно, «панночко». Час у мене ще є,\n"
"тож пограюся з тобою від нудьги."

#. Key: ArcEveLC01_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: なかなか楽しかったわ。お願いが叶うといいわね。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC01_10"
msgid "You have entertained me. I hope your wish comes true."
msgstr "Було доволі весело. Сподіваюся, твоє бажання здійсниться."

#. Key: ArcEveLC01_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: あの子、一体。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC01_11"
msgid "Who in the world...was she...?"
msgstr "Хто ж вона така?.."

#. Key: ArcEveLC02_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: やっと会えた……久しぶりね。２年ぶりくらいかな、元気だった？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC02_00"
msgid ""
"I finally found you... It's been so long...about two years,\n"
"right? Are you doing OK?"
msgstr ""
"Нарешті знайшла тебе... Давно не бачилися. Роки два, так?\n"
"Як ти?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC02_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ううう　　ああ　　キサ　　誰　。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC02_01"
msgid "Uuugh   Aah   who       you?"
msgstr "У-у-у... А-а... Ти х о?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC02_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ここまで来るのにすごーく時間かかったし、大変だったのよ？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC02_02"
msgid ""
"Do you know how long it took me to find this place?\n"
"And what I had to go through?"
msgstr ""
"Ти хоч уявляєш, скільки часу й сил мені знадобилося, щоб\n"
"сюди дістатися?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC02_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 昔みたいに、部屋にこもりっきりならすぐに見つけられたのに。
#. JA:   まったくも～、相変わらず自分勝手なんだから。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC02_03"
msgid ""
"It was so easy to find you before... I just had to go to your\n"
"room. Geez...you're always so selfish and reckless."
msgstr ""
"Раніше було так просто: ти весь час сидів у своїй кімнаті.\n"
"Ех... Ти зовсім не змінився — такий самий егоїст."

#. Key: ArcEveLC02_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 僕　　と　　って　る　か？うっ　　は知らな　　。
#. JA:   記憶　ない　　　のこと　　　知らない
msgctxt "ArcEveLC02_04"
msgid ""
"Who       you?   hav   no memorie of you.\n"
"  can't  emember anything."
msgstr "Х о ти? Я те е не пам' таю.      не прига ую. Не з аю тебе."

#. Key: ArcEveLC02_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: そっか～、忘れちゃったのか……。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC02_05"
msgid "I see... So you've really forgotten, huh...?"
msgstr "Зрозуміло... Ти все забув..."

#. Key: ArcEveLC02_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: キサマ　魔素　　　　　に　　て付加して　るだけ　　。
#. JA:   な　　ワレに　　要ない　　　、去　　　れ！
msgctxt "ArcEveLC02_06"
msgid ""
"You are just           ing       s                                    .\n"
"I hav   no              you. Begone!"
msgstr "Ти    наси уєш своє ті о маною. Мені ти не потрі на. Геть!"

#. Key: ArcEveLC02_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ごめんね、気づいてあげられなくて、とめてあげられなくて。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC02_07"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, I didn't notice...\n"
"I'm sorry I couldn't stop you..."
msgstr "Пробач, що не помітила... що не змогла тебе зупинити."

#. Key: ArcEveLC02_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 今、楽にしてあげる。
#. JA:   もう私には、こんなことしか出来ないから。ごめんね……。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC02_08"
msgid ""
"I'll put you out of your misery.\n"
"That's all I can do for you now... I'm sorry..."
msgstr ""
"Зараз я позбавлю тебе страждань. Це все, що я тепер можу\n"
"для тебе зробити. Пробач..."

#. Key: ArcEveLC02_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ぐあああああああ　　ら　　　　　いち――――
msgctxt "ArcEveLC02_09"
msgid "GUAAAAH  LITCH ...!"
msgstr "Ґуа-а-а-а-а... Лі... чі..."

#. Key: ArcEveLC02_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ！？　　あ、待って！！
msgctxt "ArcEveLC02_10"
msgid ""
"!?\n"
"W-Wait!"
msgstr "!? З-зачекай!!"

#. Key: ArcEveLC03_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ここは……。
#. JA:   空気が「境界」と似ているけど、何か違う。あっ！？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC03_00"
msgid ""
"Where am I? The air here reminds me of the\n"
"Boundary, but something's...different...\n"
"Ah!"
msgstr ""
"Це місце... Повітря тут таке, як у «Межі», але щось не так.\n"
"А!?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC03_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
msgctxt "ArcEveLC03_01"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: ArcEveLC03_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: アナタ、まさか「ハクメン」？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC03_02"
msgid "You... Are you Hakumen?"
msgstr "Невже ти... «Хакумен»?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC03_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ほう、私を知る者か。あの化け猫の縁か？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC03_03"
msgid ""
"Oh, so you know me? You must have something to do\n"
"with that Grimalkin."
msgstr ""
"Гм, ти знаєш мене? Отже, теж маєш стосунок до тієї\n"
"відьомської кицьки?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC03_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 「化け猫」ってもしかして博士の事？ひどいいいようだわ。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC03_04"
msgid ""
"\"Grimalkin\"? Are you referring to the professor?\n"
"That's terrible..."
msgstr "Відьомська кицька? Ти про професорку? Це вже занадто."

#. Key: ArcEveLC03_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: でも、アナタがここにいるってことはサルベージは成功したのね。
#. JA:   私は途中であそこを抜け出してしまったから――博士は今も元気？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC03_05"
msgid ""
"But if you're here, that means the salvage was a success.\n"
"I left midway and didn't get to see it through.\n"
"Is the professor doing well?"
msgstr ""
"Але якщо ти тут, значить, операція з повернення вдалася.\n"
"Я пішла звідти ще до завершення... З професоркою все\n"
"гаразд?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC03_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 貴様、「境界」依り何を取り入れた？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC03_06"
msgid "You... What did you harvest from the Boundary?"
msgstr "Ти... Що ти ввібрала з «Межі»?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC03_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: なっ！？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC03_07"
msgid "!?"
msgstr "Що!?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC03_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 人の目を掻い潜ろうと、私の目は欺けぬ。
#. JA:   瘴気に穢れた魂、浄化して呉れよう。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC03_08"
msgid ""
"You may have fooled the others, but you can't fool my\n"
"eyes. I shall purify that corrupted soul of yours."
msgstr ""
"Інших ти, може, й обдурила, та мого ока не обманеш. Я\n"
"очищу твою душу, заплямовану скверною."

#. Key: ArcEveLC03_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 我は空、我は鋼、我は刃
#. JA:   我は一振りの剣にて全ての「罪」を刈り取り「悪」を滅する！
msgctxt "ArcEveLC03_09"
msgid ""
"I am the white void. I am the cold steel. I am the just\n"
"sword. With blade in hand shall I reap the sins of this\n"
"world, and cleanse it in the fires of destruction."
msgstr ""
"Я — порожнеча. Я — сталь. Я — лезо... Єдиним мечем я\n"
"пожну всі «гріхи» та знищу «зло»!"

#. Key: ArcEveLC03_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 我が名は「ハクメン」、推して参る！
msgctxt "ArcEveLC03_10"
msgid "I am Hakumen. The end has come!"
msgstr "Імʼя мені Хакумен. До бою!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveLC03_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: クッ、事象干渉か！邪魔をするな化け猫め！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveLC03_11"
msgid "Guh, how dare you interrupt me, Grimalkin!"
msgstr ""
"Кх, втручання у причинність! Не заважай, клята\n"
"відьомська кицько!!!"

#. Key: ArcEveLC03_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 今のは、空間転移！？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC03_12"
msgid "That's...space-time teleportation!?"
msgstr "Це була просторова телепортація!?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC04_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 起動・起動・起動・起動・認識……
msgctxt "ArcEveLC04_00"
msgid "Loading...loading...loading...loading... Complete..."
msgstr "Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Запуск. Ідентифіковано..."

#. Key: ArcEveLC04_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ハクメンはこれを待っていたの？
#. JA:   だとしたら、かなり危機的な状況だわ。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC04_01"
msgid ""
"Is this what Hakumen was waiting for? \n"
"Then...this can't be good."
msgstr ""
"Хакумен чекав саме на це? Якщо так, становище вкрай\n"
"небезпечне."

#. Key: ArcEveLC04_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 対象・認識・自律モード・起動。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC04_02"
msgid "Target recognized. Auto-mode: activated."
msgstr "Ціль ідентифіковано. Автономний режим активовано."

#. Key: ArcEveLC04_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: もう逃げられそうにないわね。
#. JA:   でも、今の私ならあなたを窯に押し戻すことくらいはできるわ。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC04_03"
msgid ""
"I guess I can't run away anymore...but with the way I am\n"
"now, I can force you back into the Cauldron."
msgstr ""
"Схоже, втекти вже не вийде. Але теперішньої моєї сили\n"
"вистачить, щоб заштовхнути тебе назад у Котел."

#. Key: ArcEveLC04_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 対象・認識・障害・認識・排除・容認……対象を障害と認識。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC04_04"
msgid ""
"Target identified: obstacle. Elimination protocol release\n"
"requested... Request granted."
msgstr ""
"Ціль ідентифіковано. Перешкоду ідентифіковано. Усунення\n"
"схвалено... Ціль ідентифіковано як перешкоду."

#. Key: ArcEveLC04_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 彼ね、一瞬私の名前を呼んだの。
#. JA:   まだ間に合うかもしれない。救えるかもしれない。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC04_05"
msgid ""
"You know, he called my name... It was only for a\n"
"moment, but he did... I might make it in time.\n"
"I might still be able to save him..."
msgstr ""
"На мить він назвав мене на ім'я. Може, я ще встигну.\n"
"Може, ще зможу його врятувати."

#. Key: ArcEveLC04_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: だから私はここで倒れるわけにはいかないの！！
msgctxt "ArcEveLC04_06"
msgid "That's why I don't have time to be defeated here!"
msgstr "Тому я не можу тут програти!!"

#. Key: ArcEveLC04_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 対象の殲滅を開始します。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC04_07"
msgid "Activate elimination protocol."
msgstr "Розпочинаю знищення цілі."

#. Key: ArcEveLC04_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: これは、空間湾曲っ――！？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC04_08"
msgid "This is...a distortion in space-time!"
msgstr "Це... викривлення простору!?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_00_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 次の患者さんは、と、もういないみたいね。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_00_0"
msgid "Next patient? Huh. I guess that's it for today."
msgstr "Наступний пацієнт... Схоже, на сьогодні все."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_00_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: じゃあちょっとお出かけしてくるから、後頼んでもいいかしら？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_00_1"
msgid "I'm going out for a bit, so can you take care of the rest?"
msgstr "Я ненадовго вийду. Можеш тут упоратися без мене?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Linhua
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: うん、大丈夫だよ！ライチ先生。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_01"
msgid "No problem, Dr. Faye-Ling."
msgstr "Ага, без проблем, пані Лічі!"

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_02_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ありがと、２～３時間で戻ってくるからね。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_02_0"
msgid "Thanks. I'll be back in a few hours, OK?"
msgstr "Дякую. Повернуся за дві-три години."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_02_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 何かあったらハン先生を紹介してあげて。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_02_1"
msgid "If anyone comes in, refer them to Dr. Han."
msgstr "Якщо хтось прийде, скеруй його до пана Хана."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Linhua
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: え～～～、あの藪医者～～～？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_03"
msgid "Awww, that quack?"
msgstr "Фе-е-е, до того шарлатана?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_04_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ハン先生は口は悪いけど腕は確かよ。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_04_0"
msgid "Dr. Han may be blunt, but he's very skilled."
msgstr "Пан Хан гострий на язик, але лікар із нього вправний."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_04_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ん～、でも、ちょっと乱暴なところもあるかな？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_04_1"
msgid "Hmm...I suppose his people skills are a little lacking."
msgstr "Хоча... іноді він трохи грубуватий."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Linhua
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ま、仕方ないか～。あいつと違って先生は忙しいし。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_05"
msgid "Well, that can't be helped. You do get more patients than he does."
msgstr ""
"Що ж, нічого не вдієш: у вас, на відміну від нього, роботи\n"
"багато."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_06_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Linhua
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: で、今日も「下」に行くの？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_06_0"
msgid "So, are you going underground again today?"
msgstr "То ви й сьогодні підете «вниз»?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_06_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Linhua
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: よく、あの人間嫌いで有名な野蛮猫たちとまともに会話できるね。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_06_1"
msgid "I'm amazed you can actually talk to those people-hating cats."
msgstr ""
"Дивуюся, як ви взагалі примудряєтеся розмовляти з тими\n"
"дикими котами, що славляться ненавистю до людей."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: そんなことないわ、とっても素直でかわいい子たちよ。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_07"
msgid "That's not true. They're all very cute and friendly."
msgstr "Та ні, вони дуже щирі й милі."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_08_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Linhua
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: この街の奴らもすでに先生にメロメロだもんね。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_08_0"
msgid "Well, every single guy in this town is absolutely crazy about you..."
msgstr "Та все місто вже від вас мліє."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_08_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Linhua
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 先生の魅力にかかれば誰でもイチコロ……あ、腕っぷしもか。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_08_1"
msgid "...so I'm sure you can lure in anyone with your charms...er...skills."
msgstr ""
"Ваші чари будь-кого звалять наповал... В сенсі, ваші\n"
"навички."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 何かいった？
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_09"
msgid "You say something?"
msgstr "Ти щось сказала?"

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_10_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Linhua
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: いえいえ。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_10_0"
msgid "Not at all."
msgstr "Та ні."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_10_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Linhua
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ほら、先生急ぎの用事があるんでしょ？いってらっしゃ～い。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_10_1"
msgid "Say, didn't you have something urgent to do? Have a safe trip."
msgstr "Ви ж кудись поспішали, правда? Щасливої дороги!"

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: はいはい。後はよろしくね。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_11"
msgid "Yeah, yeah... Take care of the rest, OK?"
msgstr "Гаразд, гаразд. Залишаю все на тебе."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: ここ、カグツチに来て半年か……。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_12"
msgid "It's been half a year since I came to Kagutsuchi..."
msgstr "Уже пів року, як я приїхала до Каґуцучі..."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 彼の行動範囲は特定できたけど、そう簡単には会えないものね。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_13"
msgid "I've discovered where he operates, but...he's not very easy to find."
msgstr ""
"Я вже визначила, де він буває, але зустріти його не так\n"
"просто."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_14_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: でも、カカ族の皆も協力してくれるっていってるし
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_14_0"
msgid "Still, the kitties in the Kaka clan said they'd help me..."
msgstr "Та й усі з клану Кака погодилися допомогти..."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_14_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: 悩んでても仕方ないわね。
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_14_1"
msgid "...so I guess there's no point to being down."
msgstr "Тож немає сенсу сидіти й журитися."

#. Key: ArcEveLC05_15
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveLC_ArcEveLC05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveLC.pac)
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Arcade event: Litchi
#. JA: よし！行動行動、頑張らなくちゃ！
msgctxt "ArcEveLC05_15"
msgid "All right! Time for some action!"
msgstr "Гаразд! Час діяти. Треба постаратися!"
